<title>HONG KONG: Moody's says may cut ratings of three Thai banks.</title>
<headline>Moody's says may cut ratings of three Thai banks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Monday it may cut the debt, deposit and financial strength ratings of Bank of Ayudhya, Siam City Bank and Thai Military Bank.</p>
</text>
